@guide A_Nagrand
@name Nagrand (Telaar)
@faction Alliance
@levels 64-67
@zone Nagrand
@chapter Outland
@desc Telaar, the Nesingwary safari, the Throne of the Elements, the Burning Blade and the Kil'sorrow chain, and the Ring of Blood.
@next A_BladesEdge

fp Telaar
bind Telaar
accept The Ravaged Caravan | Huntress Kima.
complete The Ravaged Caravan | Telaar Supply Crate: loot Telaar Supply Crate.
turnin The Ravaged Caravan
accept Wanted: Giselda the Crone
accept Wanted: Zorbo the Advisor
accept The Nesingwary Safari | "Shotgun" Jones.
accept Do My Eyes Deceive Me | Huntress Bintook, Telaar.
turnin Do My Eyes Deceive Me
accept Not On My Watch!
complete Not On My Watch!
turnin Not On My Watch!
accept Mo'mor the Breaker
accept Fierce Enemies | Warden Moi'bff Jill.
complete Wanted: Giselda the Crone | Kil'sorrow Fortress (east).
complete Wanted: Zorbo the Advisor
turnin Wanted: Giselda the Crone
turnin Wanted: Zorbo the Advisor
complete Fierce Enemies | Obsidian Warbeads drops from Boulderfist Crusher, Boulderfist Mystic and Boulderfist Warrior and others.
turnin Fierce Enemies
turnin Mo'mor the Breaker
accept The Ruins of Burning Blade
complete The Ruins of Burning Blade
turnin The Ruins of Burning Blade
accept The Twin Clefts of Nagrand
complete The Twin Clefts of Nagrand
turnin The Twin Clefts of Nagrand
accept Diplomatic Measures | Escort quest: start it when you are ready to follow.
accept HELP! | Corki, Telaar.
turnin Diplomatic Measures | Lantresor of the Blade.
accept Ruthless Cunning
accept Armaments for Deception
complete Ruthless Cunning
complete Armaments for Deception | Kil'sorrow Armaments drops from Kil'sorrow Cultist.
turnin Ruthless Cunning
turnin Armaments for Deception
accept Returning the Favor
accept Body of Evidence
complete Returning the Favor
complete Body of Evidence
turnin Returning the Favor
turnin Body of Evidence
accept Message to Telaar
accept The Throne of the Elements | Elementalist Ioki.
turnin HELP! | Corki, in a cage at the Warmaul village.
accept Corki's Gone Missing Again!
turnin Message to Telaar
complete Corki's Gone Missing Again!
turnin Corki's Gone Missing Again!
accept Corki's Ransom
complete Corki's Ransom
turnin Corki's Ransom
accept Cho'war the Pillager
accept The Ring of Blood: Brokentoe [optional] | Gurgthock at the Ring of Blood.
complete The Ring of Blood: Brokentoe [optional] | Elite: Brokentoe; bring help or skip. Escort: stay close; it fails if the NPC dies.
turnin The Ring of Blood: Brokentoe [optional]
turnin The Throne of the Elements
accept A Rare Bean | Elementalist Lo'ap.
accept Muck Diving
complete A Rare Bean | Digested Caracoli: loot Dung.
complete Muck Diving | Muck-ridden Core drops from Muck Spawn.
turnin A Rare Bean
accept Agitated Spirits of Skysong
turnin Muck Diving
complete Agitated Spirits of Skysong
turnin Agitated Spirits of Skysong
accept Blessing of Incineratus
complete Blessing of Incineratus
turnin Blessing of Incineratus
accept The Spirit Polluted
complete The Spirit Polluted
turnin The Spirit Polluted
accept The Underneath | Elementalist Untrag.
turnin The Underneath
accept The Tortured Earth
complete The Tortured Earth
turnin The Tortured Earth
accept Eating Damnation
complete Eating Damnation | Enraged Crusher Core drops from Enraged Crusher.
turnin Eating Damnation
complete Cho'war the Pillager [group=2]
accept 9854 Windroc Mastery
accept 9857 Talbuk Mastery
turnin The Nesingwary Safari | Hemet Nesingwary's camp, north Nagrand.
accept 9789 Clefthoof Mastery
complete 9789 Clefthoof Mastery
complete 9854 Windroc Mastery
complete 9857 Talbuk Mastery
